    "parallels": [
      {
        "id": "PSA.2.1-PSA.2.6",
        "orgId": "PSA.2.1-PSA.2.6",
        "bibleId": "de4e12af7f28f599-01",
        "bookId": "PSA",
        "chapterIds": [
          "PSA.2"
        ],
        "reference": "Psalms 2:1-6",
        "content": [
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "q1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Why do the heathen rage, and the people imagine a vain thing?",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.1",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.1"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "q1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "The kings of the earth set themselves, and the rulers take counsel together, against the ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.2",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.2"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "nd"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "LORD",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "PSA.2.2",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "PSA.2.2"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": ", and against his anointed, ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.2",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.2"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "char",
                "type": "tag",
                "attrs": {
                  "style": "add"
                },
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "saying",
                    "type": "text",
                    "attrs": {
                      "verseId": "PSA.2.2",
                      "verseOrgIds": [
                        "PSA.2.2"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "text": ",",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.2",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.2"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "q1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Let us break their bands asunder, and cast away their cords from us.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.3",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.3"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "q1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "He that sitteth in the heavens shall laugh: the Lord shall have them in derision.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.4",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.4"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "q1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Then shall he speak unto them in his wrath, and vex them in his sore displeasure.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.5",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.5"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "q1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Yet have I set my king upon my holy hill of Zion.",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.6",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.6"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "verseCount": 6,
        "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent"
      },
      {
        "id": "PSA.2.1-PSA.2.6",
        "orgId": "PSA.2.1-PSA.2.6",
        "bibleId": "01b29f4b342acc35-01",
        "bookId": "PSA",
        "chapterIds": [
          "PSA.2"
        ],
        "reference": "Psalms 2:1-6",
        "content": [
          {
            "name": "para",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "p"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Why have nations assembled tumultuously? And peoples meditate vanity? ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.1",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.1"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Kings of the earth station themselves, and princes have been united together, against YHWH, and against His Messiah: ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.2",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.2"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "“Let us draw off Their cords, || And cast Their thick bands from us.” ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.3",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.3"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "He who is sitting in the heavens laughs, || The Lord mocks at them. ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.4",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.4"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "Then He speaks to them in His anger, and in His wrath He troubles them: ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.5",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.5"
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "text": "“And I have anointed My King, || On Zion—My holy hill.” ",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "PSA.2.6",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "PSA.2.6"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
